msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/pauli-prop/guides/quickstart/extracted-outputs/15d5eccf-eef0-4435-b67a-98a8038c400e-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate the time evolution of the system with Pauli propagation {#simulate-the-time-evolution-of-the-system-with-pauli-propagation}"
msgstr "Simulasikan evolusi masa sistem dengan perambatan Pauli {#simulate-the-time-evolution-of-the-system-with-pauli-propagation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once we have our circuit, $U$, and observable, $O$, we can easily simulate the system in a few steps:\n"
msgstr "Setelah kita mempunyai litar, $U$, dan observable, $O$, kita boleh mensimulasikan sistem dengan mudah dalam beberapa langkah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate $U$, into its Clifford, $C$, and non-Clifford, $P$, parts such that $U=PC$ using ``evolve_through_cliffords``\n"
msgstr "Asingkan $U$ kepada bahagian Clifford, $C$, dan bahagian bukan Clifford, $P$, supaya $U=PC$ menggunakan ``evolve_through_cliffords``\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagate $O$ through $P$, resulting in a new operator, $O^\\prime$, using ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"
msgstr "Rambatkan $O$ melalui $P$, menghasilkan pengendali baharu, $O^\\prime$, menggunakan ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Evolve $O^\\prime$ through the Clifford part of the circuit using the Clifford evolution support built into Qiskit\n"
msgstr "Evolusikan $O^\\prime$ melalui bahagian Clifford litar menggunakan sokongan evolusi Clifford yang terbina dalam Qiskit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approximate the expectation value as $\\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle \\approx \\langle0|U^\\dagger OU|0\\rangle$ by summing the coefficients in $O^\\prime$ associated with fully-diagonal Pauli terms (Pauli terms containing either ``I`` or ``Z`` on all qubits). Remember, this is an approximation because we truncated terms from $O^\\prime$ as we propagated it through the non-Clifford part of the circuit.\n"
msgstr "Anggarkan nilai jangkaan sebagai $\\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle \\approx \\langle0|U^\\dagger OU|0\\rangle$ dengan menjumlahkan pekali dalam $O^\\prime$ yang dikaitkan dengan sebutan Pauli pepenjuru sepenuhnya (sebutan Pauli yang mengandungi ``I`` atau ``Z`` pada semua qubit). Ingat, ini ialah anggaran kerana kita memangkas sebutan daripada $O^\\prime$ semasa merambatkannya melalui bahagian bukan Clifford litar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As we run larger calculations, the expectation value approximations become more accurate. In this example, we saturate the full Pauli space at around $4^{10}\\approx10^6$, which is reflected in the curve flattening out between the final two points.\n"
msgstr "Apabila kita menjalankan pengiraan yang lebih besar, anggaran nilai jangkaan menjadi lebih tepat. Dalam contoh ini, kita menepukan ruang Pauli penuh pada sekitar $4^{10}\\approx10^6$, yang ditunjukkan oleh lengkung yang mendatar antara dua titik terakhir.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "While the plot below shows a monotonic convergence, Pauli propagation simulations do not generally converge monotonically. It is not unusual to see \"bumpy\" behavior in these types of plots.\n"
msgstr "Walaupun plot di bawah menunjukkan penumpuan monotonik, simulasi perambatan Pauli secara amnya tidak menumpu secara monotonik. Adalah tidak luar biasa untuk melihat tingkah laku \"berombak\" dalam plot jenis ini.\n"

